# Goat OS — Agent Router

This is a pointer, not a rule copy. The canonical agent rules and skills already
live in the repo. Do not duplicate their content here or anywhere else.

## Single sources of truth (read, do not copy)

- **Master always-on rules**: `AGENTS.md` (auto-loaded; `CLAUDE.md`/`CODEX.md`
  are shims to it). Per-area rules live in nested `AGENTS.md` files that are NOT
  auto-loaded globally — open the one for the area you touch:
  `backend/AGENTS.md`, `apps/admin-web/AGENTS.md`,
  `apps/operator-mobile/AGENTS.md`, `apps/investor-web-shadow/AGENTS.md`,
  `contracts/AGENTS.md`, `analytics/AGENTS.md`, `infra/AGENTS.md`,
  `load-tests/AGENTS.md`.
- **Build skill**: `.agents/skills/goatos-build/SKILL.md` (+ `references/`).
  Invoke the `goatos-build` skill for product/architecture/contract/frontend/
  backend work.
- **Code-graph skill**: `.claude/skills/crg/SKILL.md`. Invoke the `crg` skill
  for any code-structure question (callers, callees, blast radius) before
  grepping or reading files.
- **Skill index**: `SKILLS.md`.
- **Agent tool routing (human)**: `docs/ai/agent-tool-routing.md` — when to use
  Cursor vs Claude Code for heavy vs light tasks.

## Required first step on any code task — 4-Layer Lookup

Work the layers in order; stop at the one that answers the question:

1. CRG (code structure) — use the `crg` skill.
2. Graphify docs graphs (business/technical context).
3. Skill references under `.agents/skills/goatos-build/references/`.
4. Grep/Read — only for what the graph cannot see (route strings, config, SQL).

## Editing discipline

- One skill source, no duplicate copies (`SKILLS.md` rule).
- New permanent rule → edit `AGENTS.md`. New routing/playbook → edit the
  `goatos-build` skill references. Never fork rules into `.cursor/`.
- Frontend gate before any push: `npm --prefix apps/admin-web run check:mock-fidelity`.
- Cursor hooks: `.cursor/hooks.json` reuses `tools/agent-hooks/` (graph-first
  guard, RTK, write-scope, post-edit contract checks). Restart Cursor after hook
  edits if they do not load.
